30,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spends way too much time chasing small payments. It's six hours a month for session fees!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Most of our costs are fixed, like insurance and hall hire. Also, many members struggle to pay all at once.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minako,,People who didn't join felt a yearly commitment was too much. Past tiered systems also caused friction.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,Charging for outings killed weekday turnout. Some members also feel guilty paying for things they rarely attend.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It's exactly as I thought. A tiny group does all the work and attends everything, while others barely show.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if people struggle with one payment, maybe smaller ones are better? But the treasurer will suffer.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, that's the dilemma. But we can't ignore that seventy percent of costs happen regardless of attendance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, if the ""quiet"" members feel uneasy, a flat fee might actually be the problem.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, but the turnout data shows that adding charges makes people stop treating the club as their own.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,We can't keep letting the same nine people carry the load while others pay the same for nothing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minato,,I don't want the next treasurer to quit. We need something simple to manage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that ensures the fixed costs are covered without guessing our income.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minako,,"We must be careful not to create ""grades"" that make people feel less welcome.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,We need to bring back the feeling that the club is open and easy to attend.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,A system that reflects actual usage seems the only fair way to stop the complaining.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
