55,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is easiest for the treasurer, but Option B seems fairer for the members.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option A guarantees our fixed costs are met, which is my main priority for stability.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option C sounds like the named-grade friction I read about. I dislike it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,"Option B might scare people away from weekday events, as the data suggested.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only one that addresses the unfairness of the current attendance gap.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, but the treasurer's hours for Option B would be nightmare. I can't support that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, if we go with A, we can offer payment plans to help those who struggle.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with Ryuji. A flat fee is invisible and doesn't categorize people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, that sounds reasonable. It keeps the ""belonging"" feeling without the hesitation of a door charge.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the treasurer's time is a cost, but member resentment is a bigger risk to the club.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm torn, but I think I'll lean toward the simplest administration.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for A. It's the only way to ensure the account doesn't run dry.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for A. It avoids the social friction of tiers or per-event costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,I'll go with A. We need to encourage people to just show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I still prefer B, but I see the consensus forming. I'll stick to my guns for fairness.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'll vote A. Let's keep it simple for the next person in charge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
